{"id":"00160","root":"uni00160_1","name":{"ja":"クリア・ローベル","en":"Clear Lovell"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"クリア・ローベル","en":"Clear Lovell"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-02-13","limited":true,"characterId":130,"profile":{"ja":"魔のものに対抗するため、化学の粋を集めて強化された存在。タイプヒーローと呼ばれるコードネームで呼ばれる。兵装の負荷に耐えれるよう、遺伝子操作も行われており、常人の数倍の身体能力を誇る。さらに特別兵装として、シンイとカムイという装備をもち、シンイは粒子により作られたブレード、カムイは常時展開可能なシールドである。感情は常に冷静であり、とても勇者と呼ばれるような責任感は持ち合わせておらず、人に仇なす存在を駆逐するマシーンと化している。ただし、時折子供っぽい動作やしぐさを見せることがあり、それが本来の性格であることが伺い知ることができる。","en":"Clear Lovell is an enhanced being created by gathering the finest of chemistry to counter demonic threats. Known by the codename \"Type-Hero,\" she underwent genetic modifications to endure the strain of her armaments, granting her several times the physical abilities of a normal human. Her special equipment includes the Shin-i blade, forged from particles, and the Kamui shield, which can be deployed at any time. She remains perpetually calm and lacks the heroic sense of responsibility, functioning as a machine that eradicates those who would harm others. Occasionally, however, she displays childlike gestures and behaviors, hinting at her true personality."},"illustrator":"なまにくATK","voiceActor":"梅原亜衣","forms":[{"id":"uni00160_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1090,2180],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[132,265],"def":[103,205],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","101001"]},{"id":"uni00160_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1680,3360],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[199,400],"def":[141,280],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","101001","101002"]},{"id":"uni00160_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2270,4542],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[271,545],"def":[184,365],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","101001","101002","101003"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":fa